      "worked": "The bearing of $C$ from $A$ is $210^\\circ$, so $\\angle BAC=210^\\circ-150^\\circ=60^\\circ$.\n\nLet $AC=x\\text{ km}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}9^2&=6^2+x^2-2(6)x\\cos60^\\circ\\\\81&=36+x^2-6x\\\\x^2-6x-45&=0\\\\x&=\\frac{6\\pm\\sqrt{216}}{2}\\\\x&=3+3\\sqrt6\\\\x&\\approx10.3\\text{ km}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe other root is negative, so it cannot represent a distance.",
